  "_comment": "build_version is the semantic version of this nddev-zcode-app build. zcode_app_version and zcode_cli_version pin the exact ZCode desktop app and CLI versions this build was verified against. Every downloadable artifact is pinned by filename, byte size, and SHA-512; platform-native identity metadata is verified before installation where available. macOS artifacts are the official ZIP update artifacts from latest.yml, not DMGs, and pin the observed Gatekeeper source per architecture. cdn_subpath is the exact per-artifact directory segment the official CDN serves the file under, between the version and the filename (macOS uses the platform-arch key; the two Linux formats share one linux-<arch> directory), so it is declared per artifact rather than derived from the key. The CLI is the zcode.cjs inside the verified app bundle, launched via node through a wrapper script."
